      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْقُولَاتٌ</span></b>  <i>Intellectual things,</i> meaning <i>things
perceived by the intellect:</i> generally used in this
sense in scientific treatises. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence, <i>Intel-ligible things.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Things approved by the
intellect;</i> or <i>reasonable.</i>]

